1
00:00:00,441 --> 00:00:04,231
...I pointed out the "check engine" light
to you several months ago.

2
00:00:04,653 --> 00:00:09,113
No, the "check engine" light is fine.
It's still blinking away.

3
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:12,330
(Penny:)It's the stupid engine
that stopped working.

4
00:00:13,078 --> 00:00:15,288
It cost me, like, $1200 to fix it.

5
00:00:16,332 --> 00:00:21,132
(Sheldon:)You know, it occurs to me. You could solve
all your problems by obtaining more money.

6
00:00:24,256 --> 00:00:27,046
(Penny:)Yes, it occurs to me too.

7
00:00:27,968 --> 00:00:29,798
(Sheldon:)Hang on a moment.

8
00:00:34,183 --> 00:00:35,813
[PENNY GASPS]

9
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:41,190
(Sheldon:)Here. Take some.

10
00:00:41,565 --> 00:00:43,105
(Sheldon:)Pay me back when you can.

11
00:00:43,275 --> 00:00:44,985
(Penny:)Wow, you got a lot of money in there.

12
00:00:45,152 --> 00:00:47,612
(Sheldon:)That's why it's guarded by snakes.

13
00:00:50,241 --> 00:00:51,991
(Sheldon:)- Take some.
- Don't be silly.

14
00:00:52,159 --> 00:00:53,909
(Sheldon:)I'm never silly.

15
00:00:55,496 --> 00:00:57,536
(Raj:)- Here.
- No, I can't.

16
00:00:57,706 --> 00:00:59,586
- Don't you need money?
- Well, yeah, but...

17
00:00:59,750 --> 00:01:01,130
(Sheldon:)This is money I'm not using.

